,"year":"2021"},{"page":7,"title":"A goat eating grass","illustrator":"Gouri Katdare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":8,"title":"Chicken eating worms","illustrator":"Gouri Katdare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":9,"title":"A chameleon tounge out to eat house fly","illustrator":"Gouri Katdare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":10,"title":"A cow feeding milk to calf","illustrator":"Gouri Katdare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":11,"title":"A boy looking at his father","illustrator":"Gouri Katdare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":12,"title":"Father lifting his son with love","illustrator":"Gouri Katdare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461215-shaanuge-yaava-oota-ishta/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಊಟ ಮಾಡು ಬಾ.”","“ನನಗೆ ಬೇಡ.”"]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461215-shaanuge-yaava-oota-ishta/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಹಾಗೆ ಅನಬಾರದು. ಗುಬ್ಬಚ್ಚಿ ಕೂಡ ಊಟ ಮಾಡಿ ಮುಗಿಸಿತು.”"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461215-shaanuge-yaava-oota-ishta/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಗುಬ್ಬಿ ಏನ್ ತಿನ್ನುತ್ತೆ? ನಂ ಗೂ ಅದನ್ನೇ ಕೊಡು.\""]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461215-shaanuge-yaava-oota-ishta/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಅಪ್ಪ ಹೇಳಿದರು, “ಗುಬ್ಬಿ ಇರುವೆ ತಿನ್ನುತ್ತೆ, ನಿನಗೂ ಬೇಕಾ?”","ಶಾನು ಹೇಳಿದ, “ಈಈಈeee... ಬೇಡ, ಬೇಡ.”"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461215-shaanuge-yaava-oota-ishta/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಬೆಕ್ಕು, ಇಲಿ ತಿನ್ನುತ್ತೆ, ನಿನಗೂ ಬೇಕಾ?”","“ಬೇಡ, ಬೇಡ.”"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461215-shaanuge-yaava-oota-ishta/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಆಡು ಎಲೆ ತಿನ್ನುತ್ತೆ. ನಿನಗೂ ಬೇಕಾ?”","“ಬೇಡ, ಬೇಡ.”"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461215-shaanuge-yaava-oota-ishta/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಕೋಳಿ, ಹುಳು-ಹುಪ್ಪಟೆ ತಿನ್ನುತ್ತೆ. ನಿನಗೂ ಬೇಕಾ?”","“ಬೇಡ, ಬೇಡ.”"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461215-shaanuge-yaava-oota-ishta/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಗೋಸುಂಬೆಗಳು ನೊಣ ತಿನ್ನುತ್ತವೆ. ನಿನಗೂ ಬೇಕಾ?”","“ಬೇಡ, ಬೇಡ.”"]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461215-shaanuge-yaava-oota-ishta/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["\"ಹಸು ಹುಲ್ಲು ತಿನ್ನುತ್ತೆ, ನಿನಗೆ ಬೇಕಾ?”","“ಬೇಡ, ಬೇಡ.”"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461215-shaanuge-yaava-oota-ishta/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಅಪ್ಪ ಕೇಳಿದರು,","“ಹಾಗಾದರೆ ನಿನಗೆ ಏನು ಬೇಕು?”"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461215-shaanuge-yaava-oota-ishta/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಶಾನು ಹೇಳಿದ, “ಮೆತ್ತನೆಯ ಅನ್ನ ಮತ್ತು ಅಪ್ಪನ ಬೆಚ್ಚನೆಯ ಅಪ್ಪುಗೆ.”"]}],"wordCount":80}